Validation Rules:
Object: Order__c

1. Validation Rule Name
Order_Date_Validation
Purpose: Prevent users from entering a future Order Date.
Formula: Order_Date__c > TODAY()
Error Message: Order Date cannot be in the future.
Error Location: Order Date

2. Validation Rule Name
Product_Price_Validation
Purpose: Ensure Total Amount is greater than zero.
Formula: Total_Amount__c <= 0
Error Message: Product Price must be greater than 0.
Error Location: Total Amount

3. Validation Rule Name
Status_Check
Purpose: Ensure an Order Status is selected.
Formula: ISBLANK(TEXT(Status__c))
Error Message: Please select an Order Status.
Error Location: Status

Object: Product__c

1. Validation Rule Name
Product_Price_Validation
Purpose: Ensure Product Price is greater than zero.
Formula: Price__c <= 0
Error Message: Product Price must be greater than zero.
Error Location: Price

2. Validation Rule Name
Stock_Validation
Purpose: Prevent negative stock quantity.
Formula: Stock_Quantity__c < 0
Error Message: Stock Quantity cannot be negative.
Error Location: Stock Quantity


